// Title: Macos Remote System Discovery
// Rule ID: 10227522-8429-47e6-a301-f2b2d014e7ad
// Severity: informational
// Tags: attack.discovery, attack.t1018
// Category: process_creation
// Product: macos
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/macos/process_creation/proc_creation_macos_remote_system_discovery.yml
//
// Generated by sigma-to-kql converter
